<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed attackers killed at least 60 Orthodox Christians in two separate incidents in Oromia and a drone strike killed two government civil servants in western Oromia. Senior Tigray Military Commander Major General Yohannes was captured near the Eritrean border. Ethiopia received delivery of 12 Russian Su-35 fighter jets and plans for S-400 air defenses amid rising tensions with Eritrea. Up to 50,000 Ethiopians have fled across the Kenya border into Moyale County. 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQSl9RZXktMzNjWWNNLUtNT1AySlhCNTltZ1ktWENhQVFWaVd3aGdDMkRZVFgzZktHWHp3Z0RKcENRb3NueEs0UHZRcS1yTmVlZTRrNndOSEhTRHBEVGJnQmc5WS1zMnQ5Ymx0VVRGNVpnR25oWG5UaVR6MTA1WXVoZXlQNEQ0WWdOeHB6eGhBSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1jSlVYMnRkUUdqbGM3R09kb2FrN0tCLWpEVFkxa0FZWnNEaWhLY0w1WGw5c1BDd1dPbEtaMXVYWWFld3lLNU9hNlRGbFlzUVRE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQc1JDTEZvV2htSjRjY19kYTViMEN3NGZiQTJIbkRldG1xaEJheG9wM2tlS3JPdDY5SFJsUFZITk9QV0lCeUtuYzNrbzZaYVFjbDdYVXRTVDBvMDJCSjkxeGFwVGNlTEQ0ZEoyNTlQTTdMTkhhSWJUbjVhZExCV214YWxjNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;International Christian Concern&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQV1dzVHRWY2ZsMUlNb2xMMnRlX0U0UkxTLURQUk1sS21TMFhZUW1PaGhFaGlGQmhMQzZuVHZ5dDZFZ2lsTmV3enUwa3dfZlZ3NUdaWUhScTZWYjZqR0QteERTbjlpT3hIckF1WURaYV8weEE3eXdGZHUyR1FvVXYxaENHMFpJaU41UU9kYnZVdlhOQTZFOUNDSWV5enRsc0hrZTBVZmg2OTUxX2FpOWhRSDFja3Vfa2hUc0Y3Qg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https